docs {
  # Get Project

  Public. Backs `/projects/[projectId]` on the website.

  | Status | Meaning |
  | --- | --- |
  | 200 | found; `message` is the project title |
  | 404 | `NOT_FOUND` |
  | 422 | `VALIDATION_ERROR` — not a 24-character hex id, rejected before the query |
}
